# 🚫 Forbidden Fire-Earth Fusion (Native Emoji)
# A dangerous combination that must not happen!

# Visual:
#   🚫 ❴ 🔥 plus 🪨 ❵
#
# Meaning: "Fire and earth must NOT fuse - this is forbidden!"
# Modal: PROHIBITED (expressing prohibition)
#
# Why is this forbidden?
#   🔥 Fire [energy: high, state: volatile, aspect: aggressive]
#   plus
#   🪨 Earth [energy: low, state: solid, aspect: protective]
#   =
#   💥 EXPLOSION! Volatile + Solid = unstable reaction
#
# Some combinations are dangerous:
#   🚫 ❴🔥 plus 🪨❵ - Fire + Earth = explosion
#   🚫 ❴⚫ plus ⚫❵ - Void + Void = annihilation
#   🚫 ❴🧠 plus 🔨❵ - Sentient + Forced = violation
#
# The 🚫 marker warns: "Do not attempt this sigil!"
# This is protective magic - knowing what NOT to do.

🚫 ❴ 🔥 plus 🪨 ❵
